## Rules wehn you show results

- if there is a modification to the file definitely you take a backup of the file in timestamped format ($(date +%Y%m%d\_%H%M%S) postfix for the backup file before modifying it.
- Based on AI result also me a Section called "Missing knowledge identifier" what shows what im missing in my knowledge and why i asked AI this partiualar question and then what I need to learn to not repeat asking this. show the information or topic and subtopic I need to master to make this dount never asked again."
  - Format:
    - Title: Title of the explanation
    - Date: Date of the explanation
    - Explanation: Detailed explanation of the topic and subtopics.
    - 2nd represetntaion of the info - A Tree diagram: If applicable, a tree diagram to visualize the Missing knowledge and subsequent topics in tree format.
  - Save this all info in the "AI Teachings.md" file in the same folder as the code or file you are explaining.
